<section class="band" id="meet" aria-labelledby="meet-title"><div class="section-wrap section-space meet"><div class="book-cover-stage book-cover"><div class="book-cover-inner"><img src="/images/book-cover-660.webp" srcSet="/images/book-cover-440.webp 440w, /images/book-cover-660.webp 660w" sizes="(max-width: 680px) 75vw, 420px" width="660" height="934" alt="The cover of Change Your Mind, Transform Your Life, by Narayani Garg" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div></div><div class="meet-copy"><h2 id="meet-title">Meet Narayani Garg</h2><div class="lockup"><strong>The Life Strategist</strong><span>Mind. Direction. Alignment.</span></div><p>An MBA and a decade running a manufacturing business came before numerology, vastu and astrology. Her book,<!-- --> <em>Change Your Mind, Transform Your Life</em>, sets out her 21-day practice for inner change.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Read her story</a></div></div></div></section>
