e">Format and fees are discussed before you decide.</p></div><div class="program-details"><div class="program-duration"><strong>6</strong><span>months of personal guidance</span></div><ul><li>Calls and messages through the six months</li><li>Space to revisit, reflect and ask</li><li>All four areas, together</li></ul><div class="program-domains"><span>Health</span><span>Relationship</span><span>Career</span><span>Money</span></div></div></div></section><section class="faq-wrap has-backdrop" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><svg class="backdrop backdrop-vastu " viewBox="0 0 300 300" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="30" y="30" width="240" height="240" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-width="1.1"></rect><path d="M56.66666666666667 30V270M30 56.66666666666667H270M83.33333333333334 30V270M30 83.33333333333334H270M110 30V270M30 110H270M136.66666666666669 30V270M30 136.66666666666669H270M163.33333333333334 30V270M30 163.33333333333334H270M190 30V270M30 190H270M216.66666666666669 30V270M30 216.66666666666669H270M243.33333333333334 30V270M30 243.33333333333334H270" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-width="0.7" class="sky-faint"></path><rect x="110" y="110" width="80" height="80" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-width="1.1"></rect><circle cx="150" cy="150" r="4" class="sky-ink"></circle><text x="150" y="14" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">N</text><text x="282" y="18" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">NE</text><text x="288" y="150" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">E</text><text x="282" y="284" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">SE</text><text x="150" y="288" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">S</text><text x="18" y="284" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle